 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking politely",
     "texto": [
      "**Ich hätte gern** (I'd like) is very polite. With another verb, **würde** + infinitive is used at the end: **Ich würde gern im Team arbeiten** (I'd like to work in a team).",
      "**Könnten** (could) is the polite form of **können**: **Könnten Sie das wiederholen?** (could you repeat that?)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Useful forms",
     "texto": [
      "**Wäre** (would be) comes from **sein**: **Das wäre toll** (that would be great). **Hätte** (would have / would like) comes from **haben**: **Ich hätte gern einen Termin** (I'd like an appointment). **Ich will** expresses will directly; for a request you can use **bitte**, **möchte**, **hätte gern**, **würde gern** or **könnten Sie …?**, depending on the sentence."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
